%!
% Ghostscript PDF/A definition: declares an sRGB OutputIntent for PDF/A-1.
% The profile path points inside the image; the Dockerfile locates Ghostscript's
% bundled srgb.icc at build time and copies it there. Ghostscript is run with
% -dSAFER, so the command line grants read access with --permit-file-read.

/ICCProfile (/opt/pdfa/srgb.icc) def

[/_objdef {icc_PDFA} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark
[{icc_PDFA} <</N 3>> /PUT pdfmark
[{icc_PDFA} ICCProfile (r) file /PUT pdfmark

[/_objdef {OutputIntent_PDFA} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[{OutputIntent_PDFA} <<
  /Type /OutputIntent
  /S /GTS_PDFA1
  /DestOutputProfile {icc_PDFA}
  /OutputConditionIdentifier (sRGB)
  /Info (sRGB IEC61966-2.1)
>> /PUT pdfmark
[{Catalog} <</OutputIntents [ {OutputIntent_PDFA} ]>> /PUT pdfmark
